G1 Z+0.5 E-5 ;X-20 Y-20 F3600 ;move Z up a bit and retract filament even more
G28 X0 ;Y0                              ;move X/Y to min endstops, so the head is out of the way
G1 Y180 F1000
M84                         ;steppers off
G90                         ;absolute positioning
